{"title":"What Else Can I Do","artist":"Encanto","sourceId":"reference:oeZbUFQ1anOMK4A5S93Z","sourceHash":"a3a70e1c85626b08332fa7a4b089e5e828db49ba81579f6f7421805855043b91","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":4.24,"end":7.24,"text":"I just made something unexpected","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":7.86,"end":10.86,"text":"Something sharp, something new","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":14.21,"end":16.67,"text":"It's not symmetrical or perfect","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":16.67,"end":19.67,"text":"But it's beautiful and it's mine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":20.48,"end":22.76,"text":"What else can I do?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":22.76,"end":24.25,"text":"Bring it in, bring it in","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":24.25,"end":26.13,"text":"Good talk, bring it in, bring it in (what else can I do?)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":26.13,"end":28.14,"text":"Let's walk, bring it in, bring it in","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":28.14,"end":30.0,"text":"Free hugs, bring it in, bring it in","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":30.0,"end":33.0,"text":"I grow rows and rows of roses","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":34.18,"end":37.18,"text":"Flor de mayo, by the mile","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":38.04,"end":41.04,"text":"I make perfect, practiced poses","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":42.19,"end":45.19,"text":"So much hides behind my smile","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":46.23,"end":48.28,"text":"What could I do if I just grew","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":48.28,"end":51.28,"text":"What I was feeling in the moment?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":51.41,"end":54.16,"text":"(Do you know where you're going? Whoa)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":54.16,"end":56.25,"text":"What could I do if I just knew","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":56.25,"end":58.66,"text":"It didn't need to be perfect?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":58.66,"end":61.66,"text":"I just needed to be? And they'd let me be?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":62.22,"end":65.22,"text":"A hurricane of jacarandas","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":65.85,"end":67.93,"text":"Strangling figs (big)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":67.93,"end":70.12,"text":"Hanging vines (this is fine)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":70.12,"end":73.12,"text":"Palma de cera fills the air as I climb","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":74.24,"end":76.5,"text":"And I push through","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":76.5,"end":79.5,"text":"What else can I do?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":79.5,"end":82.5,"text":"Can I deliver us a river of sundew?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":83.41,"end":86.41,"text":"Careful, it's carnivorous, a little just won't do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":87.32,"end":90.32,"text":"I wanna feel the shiver of something new","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":91.23,"end":94.23,"text":"I'm so sick of pretty, I want something true, don't you?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":94.28999999999999,"end":97.28999999999999,"text":"You just seem like your life's been a dream (whoa)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":98.58,"end":100.17,"text":"Since the moment you opened your eyes","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":100.17,"end":102.05,"text":"(How far do these roots go down?)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":102.05,"end":105.05,"text":"All I know are the blossoms you grow (whoa)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":105.2,"end":108.13,"text":"But it's awesome to see how you rise","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":108.13,"end":110.14,"text":"How far can I rise?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":110.14,"end":112.25999999999999,"text":"Through the roof, to the skies","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":112.25999999999999,"end":114.28999999999999,"text":"Let's go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":114.28999999999999,"end":117.28999999999999,"text":"A hurricane of jacarandas (woo)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":117.97999999999999,"end":120.97999999999999,"text":"Strangling figs (go), hanging vines (grow)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":122.1,"end":125.1,"text":"Palma de cera fills the air as I climb","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":126.29,"end":128.36,"text":"And I push through","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":128.36,"end":130.15,"text":"What else, what else?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":130.15,"end":131.99,"text":"What can you do when you are","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":131.99,"end":134.99,"text":"Deeply, madly, truly in the moment?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":135.5,"end":138.13,"text":"(Seize the moment, keep goin')","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":138.13,"end":139.91,"text":"What can you do when you know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":139.91,"end":142.66,"text":"Who you wanna be is imperfect?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":142.66,"end":144.29,"text":"But I'll still be okay","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":144.29,"end":146.17000000000002,"text":"Hey, everybody clear the way, woo","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":146.17000000000002,"end":149.17000000000002,"text":"I'm coming through with tabebuia (she's coming through with that boo-yeah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":149.99,"end":151.95,"text":"Making waves (making waves)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":151.95,"end":154.2,"text":"Changing minds (you've changed mine)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":154.2,"end":157.2,"text":"The way is clearer 'cause you're here, and well","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":157.21,"end":160.21,"text":"I owe this all to you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":160.49,"end":162.31,"text":"What else can I do?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":162.31,"end":164.42000000000002,"text":"(Show 'em what you can do)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":164.42000000000002,"end":166.5,"text":"What else can I do?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":166.5,"end":168.43,"text":"(There's nothing you can't do)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":168.43,"end":171.43,"text":"What else can I do?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}